---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import avatar from '../assets/avatar.jpg';
---

<Base title="About" description="About Ankur Singhal: an exposure scientist who combines data analytics, machine learning, and software development.">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="page-head">
      <h1>About</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          I am an exposure assessment professional with experience in data analytics, machine learning, and software development.
          I put those together to answer questions about chemicals in the environment, and to build tools that let clients and the public see the risks that matter to them.
        </p>
        <p>
          My day job is at Environmental Health &amp; Engineering (EH&amp;E), where I work on drinking water contamination, air emissions, lead, asbestos, and consumer product exposures, mostly for legal teams.
          I started at EH&amp;E as a subcontractor on a lead exposure project in La Oroya, Peru, and joined full time after that.
          Before that I worked at Exponent and ran my own consultancy.
        </p>
        <p>
          My goal is to bring data science and software development to exposure assessment, a field that has been slow to adopt them.
        </p>
        <h2>Outside of work</h2>
        <p>
          I spend a lot of time climbing, pushing the limits of my body and mind, and enjoying the mountains on long peak-bagging and backpacking days.
        </p>
        <p>
          <a href="/cv">Read the CV</a> or <a href="/contact">get in touch</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
      <aside>
        <Image src={avatar} alt="Ankur Singhal" width={544} height={544} />
        <p>How to say my name</p>
        <audio controls preload="none" src="/files/ankur-name.m4a">
          <a href="/files/ankur-name.m4a">Download the recording</a>
        </audio>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
